OL,3,GNEWSABurnham says united Ireland poll
OL,4,Ais 'off the table' during first NI
OL,5,Avisit
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham has said a united Ireland
OL,8,Freferendum is "off the table", during
OL,9,Fhis first visit to Northern Ireland
OL,10,Fsince becoming prime minister.
OL,12,F"We've got to focus on bringing people
OL,13,Ftogether as best we can, and I think
OL,14,Fwe've lived through a decade where
OL,15,Fthere's been a referendum on Brexit, we
OL,16,Fhad Scottish independence just before
OL,17,Fit," he said.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
