OL,3,GNEWSABurnham says united Ireland poll
OL,4,Ais 'off the table' during first NI
OL,5,Avisit
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe said the "rifts that come from those
OL,8,Fsituations take a long time to heal,
OL,9,Fand it sets you right back and you
OL,10,Fcan't focus on what's right in front of
OL,11,Fus here and now".
OL,13,FBurnham is spending time in Belfast
OL,14,Fhearing from young people before
OL,15,Fmeeting Stormont's first and deputy
OL,16,Ffirst ministers.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
